  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to ISDP for Korea Center 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till ISDP f&#xf6;r Korea Center 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget syftar till att st&#xf6;dja ISDP:s Korea Centers arbete med att f&#xf6;rdjupa f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;elsen f&#xf6;r situationen p&#xe5; Koreahalv&#xf6;n, &#xe5;teruppr&#xe4;tta och st&#xe4;rka dialoger samt bidra till konfliktd&#xe4;mpande insatser i en period som bed&#xf6;ms vara av strategisk betydelse.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to support ISDP&#x2019;s Korea Center in deepening understanding of the situation on the Korean Peninsula, re-establishing and strengthening dialogue, and contributing to conflict-mitigation efforts during a period of strategic importance.</narrative>
  </description>
